   "design": "Crews sign toolbox attendance on their phones in the field app ({OPS_SYSTEM}), and the supervisor records site inspections on a checklist with photos in the same app. Writing procedures, explaining them and inspecting stay with the supervisor; findings are about work and safety, not used to rate individuals.",
   "previous_blocker": "Attendance and inspections were on paper forms.",
   "enabler_now": "Field apps offer inspection checklists with photos and digital sign-in.",
   "still_hard": "Safe working depends on habits, not records.",
   "human_edge": "Stopping a worker who is about to cut a branch above their head.",
   "ambition": {
    "kind": "none",
    "what": ""
